# Tersa Lightshatter: "Whenever Tersa Lightshatter attacks, if there are seven or more cards in your graveyard, exile a
# card at random from your graveyard. You may play that card this turn." An intervening "if" is checked twice: when
# the ability triggers and again as it resolves, and it does nothing if the condition no longer holds (CR 603.4).
#
# Turn 1: Bot1 Wheels off a Black Lotus (graveyard: Black Lotus, four Islands, Wheel of Fortune = 6) and casts Sol
# Ring off its Mountain. Turn 2: Bot2 casts Ghost Vacuum. Turn 3: Bot1 casts Tersa, discarding one Island to her entry
# ability (graveyard = 7), and attacks. The trigger goes on the stack with seven cards there; in response Bot2's Ghost
# Vacuum exiles Black Lotus from Bot1's graveyard, leaving six. The trigger then resolves and does nothing, so Black
# Lotus is the only card in exile and Bot1's graveyard stays at six.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Wheel of Fortune
Island x4
Sol Ring
Tersa Lightshatter
Island x5
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x7
Ghost Vacuum
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Wheel of Fortune.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 6
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ghost Vacuum.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Tersa Lightshatter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Island)
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 7
Bot1.Attack(Tersa Lightshatter > Bot2)
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot2.Battlefield.Ghost Vacuum.Activate(Black Lotus)

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Stack.Count = 0
Exile = Black Lotus
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 6
Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain; Sol Ring; Tersa Lightshatter
Bot2.Battlefield.Ghost Vacuum.Tapped = true
